# NEXIS SITTA - Vibecoding Guidelines

## Tech Stack
- Framework: Next.js (App Router) with TypeScript
- Database & Auth: Supabase (PostgreSQL with RLS)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS & Shadcn/ui

## Code Style & Rules
1. Always write clean, production-ready TypeScript code without using `any`.
2. All database queries must respect Supabase Row Level Security (RLS) and always filter/bind `organization_id`.
3. Separate Server Components and Client Components appropriately ('use client' only when needed).
4. Use modern async/await patterns for Next.js App Router server actions.